      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CITY WOK (1) is a former Victorian who has raced twice in Tassie for the new yard, both here, and won each. Scored over this trip last time and although rising a grade looks the one to beat again. BELLA CHINKARA (4) is fitter for three runs back and should be at top now. Placed this course and distance at the first try last time, behind CITY WOK and meets the winner 1.5kg better. Has a change of rider to Newitt and looks a real threat. ALPINE COWGIRL (5) has been out of the money recently but fitter for two runs back and gets her chance to feature. BELLSPROUT (2) is yet to win fresh but has won three trials leading into this. Appears pretty wound up to run well. FIERCE 'N FABULOUS (3) is next best.",
